OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fwith some sunny then clear spells in
OL,7,Fthe evening, but cloudy with some
OL,8,Fshowery and occasionally heavy rain
OL,9,Fover Argyll, this spreading east to
OL,10,Fall parts overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FRather cloudy with scattered
OL,13,Flight showers and temperatures back
OL,14,Fnear normal for the time of year, but
OL,15,Fsome brighter spells at times as well.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMainly
OL,18,Fcloudy on Saturday with sunny
OL,19,Fintervals and a few light showers.
OL,20,FMainly dry and bright on Sunday.
OL,21,FLikely turning wet and windy on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
